#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:314
msgid "####### Constraints The TNG may be operated in front with a network component (Load Balancer, <a0>API Gateway</a0> , Reverse Proxy etc.) which handles the Client Certificate Authentication and Client Certificate Attribute extraction of the TLS connection. After the TLS Offloading it depends on the infrastructure, if an internal secured TLS network must be established or not. For example when the TNG is deployed in a distributed service mesh, it’s recommended to use TLS protected channels e.g. SPIFFE/SPIRE based service meshes. Which mode fits better to the deployment depends on the operators infrastructure. The gateway itself can be operated in a SSL Passthrough mode as well."
msgstr "####### 约束 TNG 前端可以部署一个网络组件（负载均衡器、<a0>API Gateway</a0>、反向代理等），由其处理 TLS 连接的客户端证书认证和客户端证书属性提取。在 TLS 卸载之后，是否必须建立内部安全 TLS 网络取决于基础设施。例如，当 TNG 部署在分布式服务网格中时，建议使用受 TLS 保护的通道，例如基于 SPIFFE/SPIRE 的服务网格。哪种模式更适合部署取决于运营方的基础设施。网关本身也可以在 SSL 直通（SSL Passthrough）模式下运行。"

