#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:326
msgid "In the last version of the TNG[^1] architecture, the changes for trusted issuers and trusted certificates were made to allow different types of technologies in trust verification. This could be either X509 or DIDs according to the DID Core Specification [[w3c-did-core]](en/folio-assistant-core/bibliography/#ref-w3c-did-core). During the last iterations of specification and alignment, there were some key points which must be additionally supported in the gateway:"
msgstr "在 TNG[^1] 架构的最新版本中，对可信签发方和可信证书进行了更改，以允许在信任验证中使用不同类型的技术。这可以是 X509，也可以是符合 DID 核心规范 [[w3c-did-core]](en/folio-assistant-core/bibliography/#ref-w3c-did-core) 的 DIDs。在规范和对齐的最近几轮迭代中，曾有一些关键点必须在网关中额外予以支持："

#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:52
msgid "In the peer-to-peer exchange use case, two or more gateways are able to exchange their data in a bi-directional manner. The source and the target gateway enable each other to download the data. All exchanged data will be appended to the existing data within the gateway. This can include the data of third-party gateways, if permitted by the data exchange agreement between two gateways."
msgstr "在对等交换用例中，两个或多个网关能够以双向方式交换其数据。源网关和目标网关允许彼此下载数据。所有交换的数据都将追加到网关内的现有数据中。如果两个网关之间的数据交换协议允许，这还可以包括第三方网关的数据。"

#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:57
msgid "In the primary-secondary exchange use case one or several gateways act as primary source, and another set of gateways act as secondary source . Within this mode, secondaries will download the data of the primary and append it to their own dataset or replace their dataset with the downloaded data. The primary ignores the data of the secondaries, which act just as read copies of the primary gateway. The leading national backends can connect to the primary gateway and upload the data to the one primary gateway."
msgstr "在主-从交换用例中，一个或多个网关作为主来源，另一组网关作为从来源。在此模式下，从网关将下载主网关的数据，并将其追加到自身数据集中，或用下载的数据替换自身数据集。主网关忽略从网关的数据，从网关仅作为主网关的只读副本。主导的国家后端可以连接到主网关，并将数据上传到这一个主网关。"

