#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:113
msgid "Under special circumstances when some “mass data transactions” or heavy synchronisations are necessary there may be an option to set up an adapter directly on top of the gateway database. The TNG itself supports JDBC which is able to accept other databases than mysql. For instance if a Cassandra, MongoDb or CouchDB is used and a JDBC driver is available, the data can be replicated across multiple nodes."
msgstr "在特殊情况下，当需要进行某些“海量数据事务”或大量同步时，可以选择直接在网关数据库之上设置适配器。TNG 本身支持 JDBC，能够接受 mysql 以外的其他数据库。例如，如果使用 Cassandra、MongoDb 或 CouchDB 且有可用的 JDBC 驱动程序，则数据可以跨多个节点复制。"

