#: input/pagecontent/trust_network_gateway_architecture.md:25
msgid "Within the current DCC system the centralized gateway plays the key role of establishing  trust between all of the connected Trust Network Participant. The gateway operators follow a well-documented process to establish the identity and onboard the trust anchor of each Trust Network Participant. The TNG builds upon this system to enable the creation of trust gateways by other organizations which allows to form a federated network of trust gateways, supporting all of the major COVID-19 credential certificates."
msgstr "在当前的 DCC 系统中，集中式网关在所有已连接的信任网络参与方之间建立信任方面发挥着关键作用。网关运营方遵循一套有完善文档的流程，以确认每个信任网络参与方的身份并对其信任锚进行入网。TNG 在此系统的基础上，使其他组织能够创建信任网关，从而形成一个由信任网关组成的联邦网络，支持所有主要的 COVID-19 凭证证书。"

